  <acqinfo id="aspace_5fd7d29c43d784c467ad0000b42ccdef">
    <head>Immediate Source of Acquisition</head>
<p>Donated by Annette O'Flaherty in 1997. Additional items were donated by Annette and Charles' son Brendan O'Flaherty in 2000. The accession numbers associated with these gifts are 1997.004 and 1997.016. In September 2026, Dan O'Flaherty, Annette and Charles' son, donated a quarter-inch sound reel; the accession number associated with this gift is 2026.054.</p>  </acqinfo>
